  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1/  The LB of Hounslow as the LPA hereby certify that on 23/8/2004  the erection of a roof extension incorporating a hip to gable and two roof lights to dwellinghouse,  would not  have been Lawful within the meanings of Sections 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended for  the following reason: \r\nThe proposed development would not  fall within class B Part 1 Schedule 2  of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order, 1995. \r\n2/  The submitted plans lack accuracy in that the height of the dormer roof extension is shown lower than the built dormer and therefore any calculations would not accurately reflect the actual built structure and the volume of the works.\r\n\r\n"
